## 5. Target structure

```
.github/
  copilot-instructions.md   ≤4 KB: stack, commands, invariants, doc map
  agents/                   architect, developer, tester, reviewer, security
  instructions/             razor, efcore, tests (applyTo-scoped)
  skills/                   deploy-windows, ef-migration, ...
docs/
  architecture/
    overview.md             map, invariants, decisions
    report-generator.md
    catalogue.md
    marketplace.md
  testing.md
  deployment.md
  security.md
  work/<feature>/plan.md    handoff; removed on merge
```

